t you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/6388ebb934f36b60686e6f2079f265c6.avif?t=1781697369\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/1e71bf9b47d5a35dd7d59a68088d4329.poster.avif?t=1781697369\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/1e71bf9b47d5a35dd7d59a68088d4329.webm?t=1781697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re not alone. Interdimensional guardians roam these places - and they don’t like intruders. Fight if you must. Hide if you can. But whatever you do… don’t get caught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/bedd60aa9c3ba69d2445dc7840779755.avif?t=1781697369\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/9f2d321d6eccc7d1353ec63c4487fb66.poster.avif?t=1781697369\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/9f2d321d6eccc7d1353ec63c4487fb66.webm?t=1781697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can’t control the mission. But you can control how you enter it. Every item, every perk, every decision matters. Load up, lock in, and hope it’s enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/7660666fcbbd60c77ff143feef53056f.avif?t=1781697369\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/03b9737e4c2989524fbba6849225e1e7.poster.avif?t=1781697369\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/03b9737e4c2989524fbba6849225e1e7.webm?t=1781697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time is your greatest enemy. The more objects you choose to find, the less of it you’ll have. Explore fast. Decide faster. Fail, and it’s all lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/892bddd8aeb8c26192aa06e5decaef51.avif?t=1781697369\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/f2b01f434413101dd3cec231836343cb.poster.avif?t=1781697369\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/f2b01f434413101dd3cec231836343cb.webm?t=1781697369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover your personal archive - a mysterious museum that preserves only the most important artifacts you've recovered. It’s a silent gallery of failures and triumphs. Watch it evolve with each expedition...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528320/extras/4d4144f15b6e7f73eca8057e51ab3626.avif?t=1781697369\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Challenging but Fair</strong> – No hints, no hand-holding. Fail often. Learn more each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Relax Mode</strong> – Explore without time pressure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Dynamic Loadouts</strong> – Customize perks and items before every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Fragmented Storytelling</strong> – Piece together the past through objects and environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Reactive Spaces</strong> – Your museum evolves with each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Tactile Interaction</strong> – Pick up, inspect, and sometimes mishandle what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains psychological tension, horror themes, a sense of unease, and suggestive depictions of supernatural events and violence. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore forgotten dimensions, find forbidden objects, and reveal hidden secrets. Beware - time is your enemy, and something is watching you. A mix of roguelite, horror, stealth, pressure, and secrets best left alone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Turkish, Ukrainian, Simplified Chinese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>lan